            <note corresp="#d777-f3" n="42" xml:id="d777-f3-content">
                <p>July 3, <ref target="#pg970">p. 970</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d777-f4" n="43" xml:id="d777-f4-content">
                <p>Telegram 264, July 10, 3 p.m., from Batavia, reported the text of a document
                    handed to the Dutch on July 8 with a note dated July 5 (856E.01/7–1047).</p>
            </note>
